<title>NEW ZEALAND: NBNZ cuts fixed NZ two and three-year home rates.</title>
<headline>NBNZ cuts fixed NZ two and three-year home rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Bank of New Zealand Ltd said on Monday it was cutting its two and three year fixed home lending rates, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The two-year rate falls to 9.50 percent from 9.75 percent, and the three-year to 8.95 percent from 9.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
